ement. Cue notes have a duration element, as do forward elements,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but no tie elements. Having these two types of information available can make interchange easier, as some","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"programs handle one type of information more readily than the other.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLNote","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLNote"}],"role":"symbol"}}}